7468938-1161-481e-be74-1bae71d232c6" ulx="113" uly="1188" lrx="542" lry="1220" /><zone xml:id="m-0a4c5ec5-daf8-410e-aeb7-b5ae88bdab8a" ulx="113" uly="1216" lrx="542" lry="1244" /><zone xml:id="m-8cd4d82f-5141-4886-9d7c-78e7b9a6c35f" ulx="552" uly="1217" lrx="983" lry="1244" /><zone xml:id="m-3b21f03c-9720-4fa4-85f3-892a13677caa" ulx="113" uly="1239" lrx="541" lry="1273" /><zone xml:id="m-cb9687b6-c7ef-4b5a-add3-29a76eb9f0b6" ulx="554" uly="1239" lrx="982" lry="1275" /><zone xml:id="m-37948445-c88f-4168-9873-05e46f554896" ulx="553" uly="1266" lrx="979" lry="1302" /><zone xml:id="m-abe3d72b-1e51-4389-a11b-47ab1d727b78" ulx="114" uly="1268" lrx="542" lry="1300" /><zone xml:id="m-26fc369e-9e6a-47f9-a112-d614c5af5b76" ulx="114" uly="1297" lrx="541" lry="1325" /><zone xml:id="m-f61dd352-78bc-436f-847d-54f1a92bc37d" ulx="553" uly="1299" lrx="915" lry="1331" /><zone xml:id="m-4454e286-0f09-45c8-a326-8417793bfa69" ulx="115" uly="1322" lrx="542" lry="1355" /><zone xml:id="m-ca13fdb1-3f32-4c68-98a2-de6597190a82" ulx="143" uly="1354" lrx="549" lry="1396" /><zone xml:id="m-7905db3a-f2f9-442d-9aee-145017a44f94" ulx="151" uly="1402" lrx="942" lry="1435" /><zone xml:id="m-20243f03-6775-492d-93c0-357869014f91" ulx="135" uly="1436" lrx="984" lry="1472" /><zone xml:id="m-bedeb75e-4ab6-4733-b78a-aa27fc1399ff" ulx="114" uly="1464" lrx="543" lry="1496" /><zone xml:id="m-1b0fc388-6949-4d5c-bc6a-480616128a1b" ulx="551" uly="1465" lrx="984" lry="1498" /><zone xml:id="m-adb3652a-beb1-45ed-89db-268f52e38ee2" ulx="115" uly="1494" lrx="981" lry="1533" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-6559c213-4356-4bd8-98b9-d80d2c66dfc5" n="1244" facs="#m-fa80d470-79cd-4c1c-90e6-034bdb2c82d1" /><div xml:id="m-5807fbbd-8859-405a-a73e-af4f05f5f93b">
            <lg xml:id="m-cded5302-e3ea-4a2b-8dde-7aa421a9a24e">
              <l xml:id="m-997c3374-7d07-440d-806a-b55e3c4629b8" facs="#m-83cb608d-7bb4-49ae-b017-5fa623da0ecb" label="ambiguous">1054</l><l xml:id="m-865f248d-0d47-448d-bc5a-7f074675ff10" facs="#m-e4013e3d-e787-472c-8e8a-73530c5421db" label="text-like">Saturday in Ember week of September.</l><l xml:id="m-71b2bb75-7572-4460-8fc9-5c65d36391a7" facs="#m-8d2ff37c-44d6-4392-857d-bbb33aca0f88" label="lyrics-like">misértus: sic convérsus cogitávi in! haec sunt, quae odi, dicit Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-7cacbb52-3166-45b5-8425-c768a2135095" facs="#m-0fb89948-259b-44be-8fc1-7f8536303229" label="lyrics-like">diébus istis, ut benefáciam dómui</l><l xml:id="m-8c8305db-ae23-41c4-b97b-9c0cc87d76ad" facs="#m-b645fa5d-cc07-471b-8f7a-2f654e01bb7b" label="lyrics-like">Et factum est verbum Dómini exer¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0fe96a0-0d49-47d0-8e47-761b2016bdf4" facs="#m-bee4c326-e82f-4a65-a299-84a1a463163c" label="lyrics-like">Juda et Jerúsalem : nolite timére.</l><l xml:id="m-e720d4c6-45b1-45da-9293-20f53edd932f" facs="#m-36d1e863-46c7-423b-9851-de3f2fb6558a" label="ambiguous">cituum ad me, dicens: Haec dicit</l><l xml:id="m-9159e521-0c80-4dee-9833-0bf04b24ad7d" facs="#m-3e8a064d-ea27-4a38-8ffc-317f72016a62" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus exercituum : Jejúnium</l><l xml:id="m-abf6f7b2-517d-46e3-a11c-62b1f1e56cd5" facs="#m-52e669f3-527f-44a3-a3c9-ec8af176f1a3" label="lyrics-like">Haec sunt ergo verba, quae faciétis.</l><l xml:id="m-8a07cc15-4f4c-4546-98c5-0710ec370b12" facs="#m-89e4375e-cbe7-4dc9-bfb1-91320f77e45e" label="lyrics-like">quarti, et jejúnium quinti, et jejú¬</l><l xml:id="m-51617db2-a08e-4ef7-a637-488b15f6d9f0" facs="#m-4d15af6e-0b2c-404b-b7b4-a03e33fe4c44" label="lyrics-like">Loquímini veritátem, unusquisque</l><l xml:id="m-00624445-585c-4aaa-ae4f-e3764d3a4e8c" facs="#m-fed9816f-e721-4a60-91dd-a2d7754f7910" label="lyrics-like">nium séptimi, et jejúnium décimi,</l><l xml:id="m-2571ecce-8635-4d0c-a8a0-bf68a67689fc" facs="#m-39d335ee-7577-4fc9-8a10-9b733db2e325" label="lyrics-like">cum próximo suo: veritátem, et</l><l xml:id="m-4ec7234d-6eb7-46f7-bc48-6aac0e3c6493" facs="#m-219ea906-c686-463b-983f-2e38fb36d0a7" label="lyrics-like">judícium pacis judicáte in portis</l><l xml:id="m-b36263f6-5f01-4199-b2cc-f470a725cd34" facs="#m-7434b6f1-c9df-477c-8ec5-956ca800041b" label="lyrics-like">erit dómui Juda in gáudium, et</l><l xml:id="m-51a631ce-7b22-4e80-9194-c99c7824f057" facs="#m-f366ec16-d6a0-4267-97cb-c06ca82cea3e" label="ambiguous">vestris. Et unusquisque malum con¬</l><l xml:id="m-c2615b59-f22c-4973-9efd-a7420e8f3d38" facs="#m-14f0b048-04ad-4bcf-9b74-7bbbb4458ceb" label="lyrics-like">laetitiam, et in solemnitátes prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-178c5c32-b9b7-4464-ac1c-ce1a7c5df39a" facs="#m-364398db-921f-46c0-8c0b-9b29fcc3d07a" label="lyrics-like">cláras: veritátem tantum, et pacem</l><l xml:id="m-c9a58291-4e29-4c51-b136-fa8af50a3fc2" facs="#m-d8198805-1460-4317-ae50-daa036536673" label="lyrics-like">tra amicum suum ne cogitétis in</l><l xml:id="m-17bee7b8-f323-4135-8c6e-037f94f01765" facs="#m-caf919d3-568d-43f4-8829-d40d4c4cf32e" label="lyrics-like">córdibus vestris: et juraméntum diligite: dicit Dóminus exercítuum.</l><l xml:id="m-c8c6b4bc-3d0a-4ed5-9dff-0137a32ba11d" facs="#m-cc4b09a3-37a8-4965-8f77-526bbfe7f210" label="lyrics-like">mendax ne diligátis : ómnia enim</l><l xml:id="m-8a55691b-495c-4047-b0e1-d62829a61fdb" facs="#m-ad167e91-6d9e-4b78-9196-6f14a6c3833d" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Dirigátur. p. 1060.</l><l xml:id="m-442bb094-16e2-4b04-bb85-6d1b49d60c81" facs="#m-720f07bb-947b-468f-a6d3-a151a76a22dc" label="lyrics-like">Orémus. Flectámus génua. B. Levâte.</l><l xml:id="m-81fb1f9c-c870-4cff-9deb-b32077caefd1" facs="#m-51455f4b-8f5a-4b9e-88e6-e58f2f3f12dd" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-23c521ba-b17e-4be3-8dbe-5dd57da6673b" facs="#m-21b1c1d7-3fa0-4e57-bde5-a1ea1b2407ff" label="lyrics-like">T nobis, Dómine, tribuis so- sic nobis, quaésumus, indulgéntiae</l><l xml:id="m-67da23dc-71be-4193-abe7-525576c5fc6c" facs="#m-e949d867-f2ad-4cd5-bac9-115583261753" label="lyrics-like">U lémne tibi deférre jejúnium : praesta subsidium. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b4dc0ff5-8203-4ef8-bc77-1f450a1bc951" facs="#m-e444103b-19e3-4c11-9a3a-75bb3b045147" label="lyrics-like">Lesson V. In diébus illis: Angelus Dómini. and Hymn. Benedictus es.</l><l xml:id="m-6b9750b9-6f2f-43b5-b561-e99e8840a3ff" facs="#m-0f70da82-5371-4f68-83fb-6ef574a1a3b9" label="text-like">as on Saturday in Ember week of Advent, p. 348.</l><l xml:id="m-4c8533da-9db2-4d50-8559-29662e8d3331" facs="#m-3fea8869-347d-493c-aa5b-9114d711f730" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. E. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-48763d3c-cb2a-4551-aacb-ffe769fa47a5" facs="#m-d21eaa17-c808-40bd-a0d4-95ba92431c55" label="lyrics-like">Collect. Deus, qui tribus púeris. p. 350.</l><l xml:id="m-95caa82b-3c39-4f80-b9a0-ac42056297d9" facs="#m-6098ef25-9b02-4157-bee4-071494cfcc90" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-7aa760fa-1dc2-4f14-9f30-d39811963c9c" facs="#m-490c9066-7dd0-4bbe-8e85-6a6efc47eb1b" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Hebraeos. Hebr. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-74dd0864-fce4-4239-8950-77b6d11303d4" facs="#m-e549aa5a-17d7-46f0-b971-395c23f90109" label="lyrics-like">NRatres: Tabernáculum factum! sua et pópuli ignorántia : hoc signi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e59b669a-cecf-4812-84f4-715e86d60dad" facs="#m-46ed7b8c-17b5-4a34-8114-26b2d9319233" label="lyrics-like">F est primum, in quo erant can- ficánte Spiritu Sancto, nondum pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-e1f202ba-6d31-4d35-84cf-11252286708e" facs="#m-deccc820-8942-436e-9ba9-bb7bc2f94f76" label="lyrics-like">delábra, et mensa, et propositio pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-a492d812-afba-4544-b432-c8eb4511cedd" facs="#m-62c8f512-a098-449d-8fbc-6f53398cdfc2" label="lyrics-like">palátam esse sanctórum viam, ad¬</l><l xml:id="m-aea9db15-bc0d-416a-9f5f-27751ab58269" facs="#m-3c55c18c-87f3-440d-b8c8-fca9ef10fb79" label="lyrics-like">num, quae dícitur Sancta. Post</l><l xml:id="m-fa605343-be70-4d25-a473-92a4cc4b8488" facs="#m-42f77462-9de9-4122-85f8-d63298c0aa7d" label="lyrics-like">huc prióre tabernáculo habénte</l><l xml:id="m-53101d97-8bc0-45a1-95cd-801bd4526dbd" facs="#m-a4b4b77a-f416-4bb4-8e41-5f09c6c3b320" label="lyrics-like">velaméntum autem secúndum, ta¬</l><l xml:id="m-d20759a4-e39d-485f-aafd-1256f6d72ac1" facs="#m-062b780a-eed4-40bf-ade9-ab172e124af0" label="lyrics-like">statum. Quae parábola est témporis</l><l xml:id="m-3dab5fec-a0c5-479d-a66e-bb96865110c9" facs="#m-f77b5615-df13-479c-9b43-6c0f602a86a1" label="lyrics-like">bernáculum, quod dicitur Sancta</l><l xml:id="m-2edb389b-0960-4831-96c0-99d17fa14424" facs="#m-b2ea1aa3-3a22-4cbb-ba34-4030766c1fa6" label="lyrics-like">instántis : juxta quam múnera, et</l><l xml:id="m-be75e7f6-96b6-4793-a6cf-2ccc029a8ff8" facs="#m-f39d61fd-017d-4aa0-a82b-ad42519b0681" label="lyrics-like">sanctórum : áureum habens thuri¬</l><l xml:id="m-b766eb21-7974-4619-86d0-0b79fa1438fa" facs="#m-286db732-ed14-42cb-a9b1-5e14035d67ed" label="lyrics-like">hóstiae offerúntur, quæ non pos¬</l><l xml:id="m-c13ce4f9-7293-4aab-964e-288e4993a32f" facs="#m-f9fbc479-8ca2-4209-9789-d973366195ca" label="lyrics-like">sunt juxta consciéntiam perféctum</l><l xml:id="m-16a06e40-bb6c-4c77-8c07-9ba035f17df7" facs="#m-34dfff3b-72bc-42a8-932b-e10f6c0a2b8c" label="lyrics-like">bulum, et arcam testaménti cir¬</l><l xml:id="m-808ed0c9-2a96-47b4-917e-1740a0be7ce4" facs="#m-bf3a0010-9075-4049-8301-4ff9508fb54a" label="lyrics-like">cumtéctam ex omni parte auro, in</l><l xml:id="m-b71f1320-2dd7-451f-9f1f-f1f39fddca2e" facs="#m-5912cbf7-9ab3-45c7-933a-3c71edb57a55" label="lyrics-like">fácere serviéntem, solúmmodo in</l><l xml:id="m-b0bae963-b46c-4c3c-b2a5-c33cd75ee9c2" facs="#m-5792203c-7c57-44cb-9505-fa4700562c4c" label="lyrics-like">cibis, et in pótibus, et váriis baptis¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d8d0109-4a6d-4259-93f4-28c07e060f79" facs="#m-02438d49-59df-4f48-81fc-67768380eeeb" label="lyrics-like">qua urna áurea habens manna, et</l><l xml:id="m-22c93c28-1d00-4563-adfd-d8b2d552d119" facs="#m-5ca525f5-bac7-45bd-b90b-52c783333077" label="lyrics-like">virga Aaron, quae frondúerat, et</l><l xml:id="m-cb0fe2be-2c6f-41e7-a604-44f836fe173a" facs="#m-b007fbb4-87e7-47b1-8040-cf39054bd513" label="lyrics-like">mátibus, et iustítiis carnis usque ad</l><l xml:id="m-13769319-c025-4d3a-bded-f365af3212c0" facs="#m-b5f1723a-03c1-400b-a63a-3d912e6ec5df" label="lyrics-like">tábulae testaménti; supérque eam</l><l xml:id="m-43c6a8b3-cd9f-49fc-90be-42d54cf8a9c5" facs="#m-c9fb95b0-c84c-42e5-a3ba-378d47b08d93" label="lyrics-like">tempus correctiónis impósitis. Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-34bbf49d-a380-4230-b192-b356fed83d75" facs="#m-4129ac7b-bc0f-45ee-9bed-0d51d93c1f63" label="lyrics-like">erant Chérubim glóriaé obumbrán¬</l><l xml:id="m-07e1344c-676c-43d9-b176-373de877db89" facs="#m-8b5457ec-2043-4068-a88d-a2c0534055c6" label="lyrics-like">stus autem assistens Póntifex futu¬</l><l xml:id="m-766ad8fc-2360-4c1c-a2c5-306980001951" facs="#m-70e26e1d-f320-4349-8d28-38672e4cc35e" label="lyrics-like">rórum bonórum, per ámplius et</l><l xml:id="m-5c3f7825-aedf-42ec-80ac-62131af333e5" facs="#m-bbeefa83-6947-474e-a8af-4cf023b129ef" label="lyrics-like">tia propitiatórium : de quibus non</l><l xml:id="m-9f4c2556-8a64-4560-8155-07ed373e4cd1" facs="#m-0ffb1c9b-7383-481f-838a-cd1305ceb5b7" label="lyrics-like">est modo dicéndum per singula.</l><l xml:id="m-33752557-80c1-4680-b23e-5c07898d769b" facs="#m-26d7d1b0-3eca-4310-9f25-361df9f5ecfc" label="lyrics-like">perféctius tabernáculum non manu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5804fa1f-581e-4f50-b6cc-1a121c5f69be" facs="#m-1fee1c91-6029-4eb6-96b0-388fb445f067" label="lyrics-like">fáctum, id est, non hujus creatiónis;</l><l xml:id="m-33c05fe1-a222-4e74-a8e2-a6342c654bd8" facs="#m-07468938-1161-481e-be74-1bae71d232c6" label="lyrics-like">His vero ita compósitis, in prióri</l><l xml:id="m-3842f5a9-3d9a-469c-894e-5dbc5dd0d433" facs="#m-0a4c5ec5-daf8-410e-aeb7-b5ae88bdab8a" label="lyrics-like">quidem tabernáculo semper introí¬</l><l xml:id="m-6556748e-f05a-4c7e-ac2b-399dec3df0d8" facs="#m-8cd4d82f-5141-4886-9d7c-78e7b9a6c35f" label="lyrics-like">neque per sánguinem hircórum aut</l><l xml:id="m-64b656de-b0ab-482a-bbe0-7599e430f07c" facs="#m-3b21f03c-9720-4fa4-85f3-892a13677caa" label="lyrics-like">bant sacerdótes, sacrificiórum offi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8351a21-f1f9-4865-b603-018d84438967" facs="#m-cb9687b6-c7ef-4b5a-add3-29a76eb9f0b6" label="lyrics-like">vitulórum, sed per próprium sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d6f2f5e-9f45-45c2-8235-aa9daeda618c" facs="#m-37948445-c88f-4168-9873-05e46f554896" label="ambiguous">guinem introivit semel in Sancta,</l><l xml:id="m-d6688e3e-7444-4f4c-9368-a39d6673288c" facs="#m-abe3d72b-1e51-4389-a11b-47ab1d727b78" label="lyrics-like">cia consummántes: in secúndo</l><l xml:id="m-68247270-1a83-49b2-945e-82f653ddcacf" facs="#m-26fc369e-9e6a-47f9-a112-d614c5af5b76" label="lyrics-like">autem semel in anno solus Póntifex,</l><l xml:id="m-faeb62aa-4b26-4e02-b815-2d09f6be422a" facs="#m-f61dd352-78bc-436f-847d-54f1a92bc37d" label="lyrics-like">aetérna redemptióne invénta.</l><l xml:id="m-b7c7f7ee-0720-452a-8d46-7f7e84336ec8" facs="#m-4454e286-0f09-45c8-a326-8417793bfa69" label="lyrics-like">non sine sánguine, quem offert pro</l><l xml:id="m-775290fc-303f-4f7b-8ceb-6a089b816ab4" facs="#m-ca13fdb1-3f32-4c68-98a2-de6597190a82" label="lyrics-like">Tract. Laudáte Dóminum. p. 760.</l><l xml:id="m-c81ad9e5-8243-4fd0-89f3-89fe21aea141" facs="#m-7905db3a-f2f9-442d-9aee-145017a44f94" label="ambiguous">*Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 13.</l><l xml:id="m-3eaf4e20-9102-4b0d-bc7a-94a84873db29" facs="#m-20243f03-6775-492d-93c0-357869014f91" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dicébat Jesus in vinea sua, et venit quaerens</l><l xml:id="m-7cb11417-3e0e-4255-8b7e-a4ac7bf5dbb7" facs="#m-bedeb75e-4ab6-4733-b78a-aa27fc1399ff" label="lyrics-like">I turbis hanc similitúdinem : Arbo¬</l><l xml:id="m-c7d41373-0110-4ffd-b964-a8b8586bd2a7" facs="#m-1b0fc388-6949-4d5c-bc6a-480616128a1b" label="lyrics-like">fructum in illa, et non invénit. Di¬</l><l xml:id="m-30f2c631-842e-41c4-99bf-a754552c3cb1" facs="#m-adb3652a-beb1-45ed-89db-268f52e38ee2" label="lyrics-like">rem fici habébat quidam plantátam ! xit autem ad cultórem vineae</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>